        ],
        [
          221,
          221
        ]
      ],
      "note": "Line 14: equalPath ignores case on Windows and compares exactly elsewhere; line 222 uses it to check that a file maps back to the same pack path. Lines 31 and 221 split native paths on path.sep (from path.resolve and path.relative, so native on each system) and line 221 rejoins with '/'. Linux runs the exact-compare branch only; the witness rule keeps a PC file that loads this module running fresh on Windows in the same release, and neutral files passed with equal counts on both systems."
    },
